							<li>15 questions</li>
							<li>About 4 minutes</li>
							<li>Immediate results</li>
						</ul>
						<button class="button assessment-button" type="button" disabled>Check Your Grip</button>
					</div>

					<article class="score-card" id="grip-score-card" aria-labelledby="score-card-heading">
						<p class="score-eyebrow" id="score-card-heading">Sample Grip Score</p>
						<div class="score-profile">
							<svg class="score-ring" viewBox="0 0 520 300" role="group" aria-label="Five-section Operational Grip score profile">
								<g transform="translate(260 250)">
									<path id="ring-demand" data-section="demand" class="score-segment score-segment-strong" d="M -210 0 A 210 210 0 0 1 -170 -123" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-controls="result-demand" aria-label="Response to Changing Demand, 95 percent, Strong" aria-pressed="false"></path>
									<path id="ring-ownership" data-section="ownership" class="score-segment score-segment-weak" d="M -158 -139 A 210 210 0 0 1 -65 -200" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-controls="result-ownership" aria-label="Ownership and Bounded Execution, 35 percent, Weak" aria-pressed="false"></path>
									<path id="ring-results" data-section="results" class="score-segment score-segment-strong" d="M -48 -204 A 210 210 0 0 1 48 -204" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-controls="result-results" aria-label="Observable and Traceable Results, 90 percent, Strong" aria-pressed="false"></path>
									<path id="ring-adaptation" data-section="adaptation" class="score-segment score-segment-strong" d="M 65 -200 A 210 210 0 0 1 158 -139" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-controls="result-adaptation" aria-label="Adaptation Without Loss of Control, 90 percent, Strong" aria-pressed="false"></path>
									<path id="ring-ai" data-section="ai" class="score-segment score-segment-moderate" d="M 170 -123 A 210 210 0 0 1 210 0" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-controls="result-ai" aria-label="AI Use and Control, 60 percent, Moderate" aria-pressed="false"></path>
								</g>
							</svg>
							<p class="overall-score" aria-label={`Overall score ${overallGripScore} out of 100`}>
								<strong>{overallGripScore}</strong><span>/100</span>
							</p>
							<img class="hands-bar" src="/assets/operational-grip/hands-bar.png" alt="One hand holds a bar securely while the other begins to lose its grip." />
						</div>

						<div class="score-results" aria-label="Sample results by assessment section">
							{assessmentResults.map((result) => (
								<button
									class:list={["score-result", `score-result-${result.key}`]}
									id={`result-${result.key}`}
									type="button"
									data-section={result.key}
									aria-controls={`ring-${result.key}`}
									aria-pressed="false"
								>
									<span class="score-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
									<span class="result-label">{result.label}</span>
									<strong>{result.score}%</strong>
									<span class="result-strength">{result.strength}</span>
								</button>
							))}
						</div>

						<div class="overall-reading">
							<h3>Overall Reading</h3>
							<p>Generally strong grip with a concentrated weakness in Ownership and Bounded Execution.</p>
						</div>
					</article>
				</div>
			</section>

			<section class="section approach-section section-rule" aria-labelledby="approach-heading">
				<div class="shell">
					<div class="section-heading narrow-heading">
						<p class="eyebrow">How 3Back works</p>
						<h2 id="approach-heading">Evidence first. One bounded problem at a time.</h2>
						<p class="lead-copy">3Back examines the actual work system before prescribing a solution. We preserve what works, identify the real constraint, and recommend a change that can be owned, observed, and corrected.</p>
